<p>Hello there, wayward internet traveler! Let us help you get back on the right trail.</p><ul><li><h2>  <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="47a7d468-eff9-4490-9327-649631f2ab69" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/programs-services" rel aria-label="Programs &amp; Services">  Programs &amp; Services</a></h2><p>Searching more by topic? This is a good round-up of the many programs and services we offer to help Iowans join us in caring for our natural resources, such as information on   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="50a3bf1a-aeb2-40ef-ac1c-dee459a2dd79" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="[long]" rel aria-label="aquatic invasive species">  aquatic invasive species</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8f127447-bf08-4435-aa32-a508f538ea45" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/swimming" rel aria-label="beach monitoring">  beach monitoring</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="3d941204-4e54-4dd4-b556-83dba2a7e122" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="[long]" rel aria-label="forestry">  forestry</a>,<a href="/node/197" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a27fb035-b5b7-4656-9196-a2abc092e092" data-entity-substitution="canonical"> lake restoration</a>, reducing food waste and more.</p></li><li><h2>  <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c30fd06a-d30a-4ba9-8fab-cb8ee7fecc83" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go" rel aria-label="Places to Go">  Places to Go</a></h2><p>If you're looking to get outdoors, we have just the place for you! Here you'll find information about   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f8dfbe9f-37ac-4016-8061-54b6597ba6a0" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go/state-forests" rel aria-label="Iowa's state forests">  Iowa's state forests</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="4c54063c-899c-44f8-8af9-e25ff8d112cc" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go/state-parks" rel aria-label="state parks">  state parks</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="823a3f86-7594-41b0-9451-1b80830e0a80" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go/state-preserves" rel aria-label="state preserves">  state preserves</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="fdcc2236-f1cc-4daf-b107-1b5d92d16f04" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go/shooting-ranges" rel aria-label="shooting ranges">  shooting ranges</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="3339fa64-02d6-4a72-85ce-43b67d6a716b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/highway-vehicles" rel aria-label="OHV parks and riding areas">  OHV parks and riding areas</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="4310ee06-c5e4-4ed2-858d-69d9dbf0130c" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go/water-trails" rel aria-label="water trails">  water trails</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="d149a7c1-73d9-478a-9806-ec38bc92eb1d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/places-go/wildlife-management-areas" rel aria-label="wildlife management areas">  wildlife management areas</a> and more places to explore.</p></li><li><h2>  <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="e97d64e9-d1bd-4abc-9654-3c7ea863bd7b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do" rel aria-label="Things to Do">  Things to Do</a></h2><p>There's so much to do in Iowa's outdoors! Get out and   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="cd70836c-b081-44fe-be74-e114ed21fc6a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/bird-watching" rel aria-label="watch the birds">  watch the birds</a>, hit the lake for some   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9a48ce27-c0aa-4471-8758-5a084bd81502" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/boating" rel aria-label="boating">  boating</a> or kayaking, go   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="aa66ea01-d38d-4944-8eab-42e66f94cce3" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/node/184" rel aria-label="camping">  camping</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="eabef88f-f81f-4f78-b23c-ca0ec6f123f2" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/fishing" rel aria-label="fishing">  fishing</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f9cf42db-9c28-499e-b348-ca98029b284c" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/hunting-trapping" rel aria-label="hunting">  hunting</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8f127447-bf08-4435-aa32-a508f538ea45" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/swimming" rel aria-label="swimming">  swimming</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="05e54ae6-87a4-4f65-b3be-6c01feed6237" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/things-do/snowmobiling" rel aria-label="snowmobiling">  snowmobiling</a> and a whole lot more.&nbsp;</p></li><li><h2>  <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b8f3765b-482e-4693-a917-1da1671c851d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/environmental-protection" rel aria-label="Environmental Protection">  Environmental Protection</a></h2><p>Taking care of Iowa's   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="44d39ee4-1a56-4846-ab38-d6b3cd87ce03" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/environmental-protection/air-quality" rel aria-label="air quality">  air quality</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="760d89d8-ad6f-4d64-85b8-f648257e1d87" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/environmental-protection/land-quality" rel aria-label="land quality">  land quality</a>,   <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="df204143-2a34-4748-a880-ced5a0d624b0" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/environmental-protection/water-quality" rel aria-label="water quality">  water quality</a> is an important part of our agency mission. Here, you'll find info on what you can do in your home and community to care for our natural resources, as well as information for regulated communities.</p></li><li><h3>  <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ef968fb9-13fc-41a5-be4c-4ea176a797c4" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/about" rel aria-label="About the Iowa Department of Natural Resources">  About the Iowa Department of Natural Resources</a></h3><p>Learn about who does what where in our agency with important points of contact across our agency.</p></li></ul><hr><h3>Still not sure which way to go or need a seasoned trail guide?&nbsp;</h3><p><a href="https://directory.iowa.gov/"><strong>Iowa Directory Services</strong></a> offers access to the State of Iowa Employee Directory as well as the option to find a State agency or department.</p><p>    <a data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="08b62f9a-467f-45e3-9a4b-219dda7fe51b" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" target="_blank" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/media/1596/download?inline" rel aria-label="  Iowa DNR staff and office information by county                            (529.4 KB)                                            .pdf                    , opens in new window (PDF document)." data-entity-file-mimetype="application/pdf">  Iowa DNR staff and office information by county    <span class="link__details">              <span class="link__filesize">          (529.4 KB)        </span>                          <span class="link__filetype">          .pdf        </span>          </span>  </a> is a detailed county listing of conservation officers and supervisors, recreational safety officers, fisheries and wildlife biologists, environmental field offices, nuisance wildlife control operators, wildlife rehabilitation operators, county recorders and county conservation boards.&nbsp;</p><p>  <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c7fbf680-719a-462b-830b-f9c35c880fd6" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-component-id="wildrose:link" data-component-variant="paragraph" class="sdc-component link-paragraph" href="/about/contact/staff-offices" rel aria-label="DNR Staff &amp; Offices">  DNR Staff &amp; Offices</a> provides an overview of our various bureaus and divisions and includes staff contact information.</p><p><strong>Iowa DNR Customer Service:</strong> <a href="tel:515-725-8200">515-725-8200</a>&nbsp;<br>Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. CST<br><em>(except for state holidays)</em></p></div>
      
      
